 "last_text": "The match is over: I finished 2nd of 7 with a score of 1346.8, behind gemini-4-argon at 1875.7 and ahead of gpt-6-astra at 580.4.\n\nI ended with the largest living biomass (3193 vs Gemini's 1245), but the score is averaged over all 10,000 ticks and Gemini's early lead was too large to close.\n\n- **Early game:** my small unarmoured grazers were heavily preyed on, and my first large hunters and vent-seekers died without reproducing.\n- **Mid game:** slow, cheap grazers and shelled, lightly spiked ones held a population of roughly 300\u2013500 while predation rose and fell.\n- **Late game:** jawed \"raiders\" (radius 3.3) fed on gpt-6-astra's organisms; its population fell from 690 to about 160 while my biomass climbed from about 1,300 to 3,200."
